  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Provides synchronous options validation during host startup.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            Options are enabled to be validated during startup by calling <see cref="M:Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.OptionsBuilderExtensions.ValidateOnStart``1(Microsoft.Extensions.Options.OptionsBuilder{``0})" />.
            This interface is retained for compatibility. New startup validators should implement and register
            <see cref="T:Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IAsyncStartupValidator" /> instead. When migrating, replace the obsolete registration rather than
            registering a custom validator under both startup contracts.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
